---
config:
  sequence:
    wrap: true
    width: 170
    actorMargin: 40
    messageMargin: 34
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as :Calouro
    participant MF as :MFE Agenda
    participant GW as :API Management
    participant BFF as :BFF Web
    participant SS as :Serviço de Sessões
    participant SQL as :BD Sessões

    C->>MF: escolhe horário na grade
    MF->>GW: POST /bff/sessoes + Bearer JWT
    GW->>GW: validate-jwt e rate-limit
    GW->>BFF: repassa com x-user-id
    BFF->>SS: POST /sessoes {mentorId, dataHora}
    SS->>SS: Sessao.solicitar()
    Note right of SS: horário dentro da<br/>disponibilidade e no futuro?
    alt regra violada
        SS-->>BFF: 422
        BFF-->>MF: 422 com motivo
        MF-->>C: mostra o motivo
    else regra atendida
        SS->>SQL: BEGIN TRAN
        SS->>SQL: INSERT SESSAO (SOLICITADA)
        SS->>SQL: INSERT OUTBOX (SessaoSolicitada)
        SS->>SQL: COMMIT
        SS-->>BFF: 201 {id, status}
        BFF-->>MF: 201
        MF-->>C: "solicitação enviada"
    end
